      "writtenOn": "2025-10-02T20:16:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is a standard technique; we use it in SkData and SkTextBlob. The +1 is completely well defined, since it adds sizeof(*this) to the pointer. This also gives us well defined alignment -- the same alignment as the this itself. In the case of SkPataData, we\u0027ll be aligned the same as a pointer, since SkPathData contains spans (which have pointers).",
